  "ingredients": [
    "4 boneless, skinless chicken breasts",
    "1.5 cups shredded pepperjack cheese",
    "1 (4 ounce) can diced green chile peppers, drained",
    "1 tablespoon dry fajita seasoning"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vLnxaVlzM7kYcweII1T6putk1Ew=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84717_GreenChiliandCheeseChicken_ddmfs_step2_4x3_1901-98e3334ff55344fe99ad566d29270970.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84717/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Coat a 9 inch square baking dish (or similar size) with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a deep cut into the side of each chicken breast half to form a pocket or 'purse'.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZoywBLW7Z54uky7Tl1m8tOwJ03A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84717_GreenChiliandCheeseChicken_ddmfs_step2_4x3_1905-1556a92b1f67459e8b2d620689038dcf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84717/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stuff 1/4 cup of cheese and about 1 tablespoon of the chilies onto each one. Close, and secure with a toothpick so that the cheese does not escape while in the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sw0COy2o-37HUim3IfsL9QFFGh8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84717_GreenChiliandCheeseChicken_ddmfs_step4_4x3_1913-8bec531207064e9ca99e9026724cc793.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84717/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the stuffed chicken into the baking dish. Season with Fajita seasoning, and then sprinkle the remaining cheese and chilies over the top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UcHhAa0wMXL_r_u_3eCxQh2-sls=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84717_GreenChiliandCheeseChicken_ddmfs_step4_4x3_1909-74f5ebfe12094abebc46a8c743b8c504.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84717/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake uncovered for 30 minutes in the preheated oven, until the chicken juices run clear, and cheese is melted and lightly browned.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T6bTvKKimTT18Dmrrx0HV9nKA3E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/84717_GreenChiliandCheeseChicken_ddmfs_step5_4x3_1941-c7604f5196194607b13760e496bfb72b.jpg"
